                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It sure is moe/cute. Unfortunately the art alone isn't enough to carry the game and I didn't like the rest much. I wouldn't recommend playing it just because you like the art.\n\nThat said, I'm not sure if it's a bad game, tactical RPGs may just not be my thing, it isn't what I usually play. There seems to be a lot of variety in available creatures and strategies, so if you like tactical battles you may enjoy this game. But if you just like the cute art, you'll probably get bored pretty quickly and you'd be better off playing a different cute game or watching anime.",
